  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/658/658-34.htm",
  "statuteText": "658:34 Pasters. –\n\nIf pasters are to be used at the election and have been delivered to the town or city clerk, the clerk shall deliver the pasters to the moderator who shall cause them to be pasted in the proper place on each ballot before it is handed to the voter."
}
